{
  "version": "2026-04-24",
  "name": "feishu_interactive_05_risk",
  "description": "正式版 05 风险 interactive card 模板。用于风险通报、影响同步与待决策项升级。",
  "message_type": "risk",
  "message_code": "05",
  "label": "风险",
  "msg_type": "interactive",
  "card": {
    "config": {
      "wide_screen_mode": true,
      "enable_forward": true
    },
    "header": {
      "template": "red",
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "{title_prefix}｜05 风险"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "风险通报 · {task_name}"
      }
    },
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**✦ 风险概览**\n事项名称｜{task_name}\n当前责任人｜{owner_mention}\n需拍板人｜{decision_maker_mentions}\n当前状态｜{status}\n风险目标｜{goal}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◈ 风险影响**\n1. 风险点｜{risk_1}\n2. 影响范围｜{impact_1}\n3. 建议动作｜{action_suggestion}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◔ 时点与状态**\n当前状态｜{status}\n处理时限｜{deadline}\n下一节点｜{next_milestone}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**☰ 需要动作**\n{actions_md}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**⊘ 边界提醒**\n{guardrails_md}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**receipt｜**以回读与 mention 验证为准。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "default_values": {
    "decision_maker_mentions": "Hermes_CEO"
  },
  "business_sections": {
    "actions": {
      "render_key": "actions_md",
      "legacy_prefix": "action_item_",
      "required": true,
      "max_items": 3
    },
    "guardrails": {
      "render_key": "guardrails_md",
      "legacy_prefix": "guardrail_",
      "required": true,
      "max_items": 3
    }
  },
  "required_placeholders": [
    "title_prefix",
    "task_name",
    "owner_mention",
    "goal",
    "risk_1",
    "impact_1",
    "action_suggestion",
    "status",
    "deadline",
    "next_milestone",
    "actions_md",
    "guardrails_md"
  ]
}
